<title>FRANCE: Arthuis says 2.3 pct '97 growth forecast a minimum.</title>
<headline>Arthuis says 2.3 pct '97 growth forecast a minimum.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>French finance minister Jean Arthuis said on Thursday he expected the economy to grow at least 2.3 percent this year.</p>
<p>&quot;Growth for this year should be 2.3 percent, and I consider that level a minimum,&quot; he said in a speech.</p>
</text>
